@startuml Architectural-Overview
!pragma layout smetana
title VoxTypeMac - macOS 27 local dictation runtime map

top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 48
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

component "1. Control plane\nVoxTypeApp / AppDelegate\nGlobalHotkeyMonitor · AppModel · PermissionsManager\nSources/VoxType/ · quit waits for stop" as control
component "2. Audio capture\nAudioCapture.swift\nAVAudioEngine tap · 256-frame PCM\nraw .caf + waveform samples" as capture
component "3. Apple speech\nSpeechPreparationCache.swift\nNativeSpeechEngine.swift\nSpeechAnalyzer + DictationTranscriber\nselected en-US / zh-CN locale\nlive/final text" as speech
component "4. Final text policy\nTranscriptRefinement.swift\nRefinementService.swift\nQwen3-ASR · MLX Metal GPU\n90 s bound · SenseVoice fallback\nChinese mixed speech allowed\nEnglish mode rejects CJK refinement" as text
component "5. Verified delivery\nOutputDispatcher.swift\nClipboardSnapshot.swift\nAX target · paste confirmation · clipboard fallback" as delivery
component "6. Presentation\nHUDController.swift · canJoinAllApplications\nDisplayLinkedWaveform.swift · CADisplayLink\nhigh-refresh smooth waveform · Reduced Motion\nmenu popover stays open for record/stop/copy\nrestores latest saved transcript" as presentation

storage "Archive boundary\nSessionStore actor · SettingsStore · SettingsFile\nconfig · recordings · text · metadata · models\ncontained Application Support paths" as archive
rectangle "Apple SpeechAnalyzer assets" as apple
rectangle "Pinned public model artifacts\nQwen / MLX community / SenseVoice" as artifacts
rectangle "macOS TCC + original focused target app\nMicrophone · Speech Recognition · Input Monitoring · Accessibility" as platform

control -down-> capture : start / stop
capture -down-> speech : PCM buffers
speech -down-> text : live / final text
text -down-> delivery : selected transcript
capture -right-> presentation : meter samples

capture -right-> archive : raw audio
text -right-> archive : final text + metadata
speech -left-> apple : prepare assets
text -left-> artifacts : setup downloads only
delivery -right-> platform : permission / paste

note right of speech
  Stop drains the capture and speech queues before delivery.
  The converter is flushed and input is finalized through end-of-input.
end note

note left of text
  If refinement is empty, failed, truncated, short, language-flipped,
  or worse, AppModel keeps Apple's transcript. Finalization failure
  keeps live text when available; raw audio remains on disk.
end note

@enduml
